	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Appearing as Tiny galaxies in the form of a nightjar, these unusual birds are only found in the astral plane, where they flit and dance in the spaces in between worlds. While they are beautiful, they also serve as a sign that a gate or portal to another plane of existence is close by. Adventurers who see astral nightjars while in the astral plane have advantage on their Survival check to navigate to the nearest portal.</p>",
